<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<class name="RailVehicleDieselElectricEngine" inherits="RailVehicleDieselEngine" api_type="extension" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot/master/doc/class.xsd">
	<brief_description>
		Diesel engine handler class, for vehicles with an electric transmission (generator + traction motors).
	</brief_description>
	<description>
		[RailVehicleDieselElectricEngine] extends [RailVehicleDieselEngine] with the FIZ fields specific to vehicles with
		[code]EngineType=DieselElectric[/code] (electric transmission). Note that the mechanical-transmission
		properties inherited from [RailVehicleDieselEngine] (torque converter, retarder, gearbox throttle table) do not
		apply to this engine type and should be left at their defaults.
	</description>
